7.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-13 00:50:43','2026-08-06 00:32:14','2026-08-13 00:52:46'),(52,355,'DEFAULT GENDER','Encoding Profile','This is after spending a few minutes editing profiles because of wrong genders. Would it be possible po to change the default gender to \'male\' as most farmers who sell their palay are of that gender. Though very minor problem lang po ito, the fraction of a second needed to change the gender from female to male would pile up for thousands of entries. \r\n\r\nthank you!',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 07:01:04','2026-08-07 00:39:08','2026-08-25 07:01:11'),(53,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fwsp/index.php\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-13 00:50:43','2026-08-10 02:45:27','2026-08-13 00:52:46'),(54,462,'Inclusion of Buying Stations as facility at Surigao del Sur, CARAGA','Encoding Profile','please include\r\n1.  \"Libas Sud Buying Station\" addressed at Brgy. Libas Sud, San Miguel, SDS\r\n2. \"Poblacion Buying Station\" addressed at Brgy. Poblacion, San Miguel, SDS',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 08:19:06','2026-08-10 03:17:10','2026-08-25 08:19:15'),(55,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fwsp/index.php\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/109.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-13 00:50:43','2026-08-11 00:32:25','2026-08-13 00:52:46'),(56,16,'There are insufficient options in the landholding data','Encoding Profile','There are insufficient options in the landholding data. Like Farm worker, lessee/leaseholder, Farm Administrator.',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 08:33:05','2026-08-11 01:33:59','2026-08-25 08:36:38'),(57,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fwsp/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 AVG/150.0.0.0',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-13 00:50:43','2026-08-12 01:11:56','2026-08-13 00:52:46'),(58,158,'DUPLICATE WSR NUMBER','Encoding Transaction','The first transaction I encoded was not successful. I re-encoded the transaction, but the system indicated that the WSR was a duplicate. I checked the transaction records, but there was no recorded transaction.','assets/uploads/support/ticket-158-1786514367-4904ddf1.png','Open',0,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-12 05:59:27','2026-08-14 02:55:49'),(59,158,'INCLUDE DAVAO CITY IN THE \"PROVINCE\"','Location Library','Good afternoon, Sir. May we respectfully request that “Davao City” be added to the \"Province\" list, as it is under our AOR. Thank you very much.','assets/uploads/support/ticket-158-1786517152-b74f5972.png','Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-14 02:50:24','2026-08-12 06:45:52','2026-08-25 08:19:20'),(60,67,'Additional Province under the Branch Office','Location Library','Good day, Sir/Ma’am.\r\n\r\nRespectfully requesting the addition of Davao de Oro Province under the Davao del Norte Branch Office. The warehouses located in the said province are already included in the list; however, Davao de Oro Province itself is not yet reflected.\r\n\r\nAlso, for uniformity, may we request to indicate “Davao del Norte Branch Office” instead of just “Davao del Norte”?\r\n\r\nThank you.',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-14 02:32:39','2026-08-12 06:47:57','2026-08-14 02:32:49'),(61,122,'Double entry of farmer profile of JESTONI Mahinay','Encoding Profile','Good afternoon po, pde po ba ipadelete yung isang profile, thanks','assets/uploads/support/ticket-122-1786527614-956d3bff.png','Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-13 03:43:42','2026-08-12 09:40:14','2026-08-13 03:43:49'),(62,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fwsp/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-13 00:50:43','2026-08-13 00:05:49','2026-08-13 00:52:46'),(63,458,'Missing RSBSA Number in Farmer Profile and Transaction Encoding Issue','Encoding Transaction','Good day, Sir! Thinking that the farmer\'s profile was editable, I encoded the name and address of a farmer who made a delivery but had incomplete details, just to comply with the instruction to prioritize encoding farmers who sold palay for the month of July, since their FIS were lacking or missing.\r\nThe farmers encoded with incomplete details, particularly Soriano Talisay and Jestoni Mahinay, were tagged orange. When I tried to encode their individual deliveries, the system prompted: \"The transaction could not be recorded. Check for a duplicate WSR number and verify all required values.\" I checked for duplicates and found none. I concluded that records with an orange tag cannot be recorded under individual delivery.\r\nWhen my colleague provided me with the RSBSA Number of Soriano Talisay, I filled it in just to test whether the transaction would be accepted once an RSBSA Number was present, but the system prompted: \"The record already exists.\"\r\nConcerns:\r\n1. Is it really not possible to encode a farmer\'s delivery if the details in their farmer profile are incomplete?\r\n2. Why does the system prompt that the RSBSA Number already exists when I found no duplicate?','assets/uploads/support/ticket-458-1786613324-369c6230.png','Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 08:33:30','2026-08-13 09:28:44','2026-08-25 08:36:38'),(64,458,'Clarification','Encoding Transaction','I observed that the total amount is computed by multiplying the price per kilo by the NKG. If the variety is PD1A, the result is exact. However, if we change it to PD1B, PD2A, or PD2B, we have to replace the NKG value with the equivalent net weight just to arrive at the correct total amount. In this case, the information we input in the system no longer matches our data, which has already been reconciled with the Accounting Section. Should we really be entering the equivalent net weight (ENW) in the NKG field?',NULL,'Open',1,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-13 09:58:47','2026-08-25 08:35:42'),(65,458,'System Enhancement Request: Auto-fill of Verified Farm Area (ha) Field','Other Concern','We would like to request a system enhancement so that upon selecting or clicking a farmer from the list, the harvested area field is populated automatically using the value stored in the farmer\'s record.',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 08:35:59','2026-08-13 10:29:45','2026-08-25 08:36:38'),(66,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fwsp/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/109.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-14 02:09:42','2026-08-14 01:08:33','2026-08-14 02:11:40'),(67,316,'LESSEE/LEASEHOLDER OPTION ON LANDHOLDING DATA','Encoding Profile','ON OUR NEW FIS, THERE IS A LESSEE/LEASEHOLDER OPTION ON LANDHOLDING DATA. BUT ON THE SYSTEM, IT IS NOT INCLUDED.','assets/uploads/support/ticket-316-1786679761-99bdd401.jpeg','Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 08:36:17','2026-08-14 03:56:01','2026-08-25 08:36:38'),(68,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fwsp/index.php\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Mobile Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:59:49','2026-08-14 08:39:58','2026-08-25 07:00:10'),(69,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fwsp/?fbclid=IwY2xjawTsw25wZG9mBWV4dG4DYWVtAjExAHNydGMGYXBwX2lkDDM1MDY4NTUzMTcyOAABHnEmYhjQqqk_EWSMkkl9F_1ES4NuC-DDcBIYegecG7E2O8aJ60f8Yrt6r7sW_aem_mDw6xuuISghvON27uQetxA\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.