or\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/138.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:32:15','2026-08-18 05:52:59','2026-08-25 06:32:32'),(79,129,'Inclusion of Aurora on the Dropdownlist','Encoding Transaction','Sir Paw and the ICTSD Team;\r\n\r\nI\'m checking the records of transaction of Region 3, specifically Nueva Ecija Branch as of August 18, 2026. Kindly include Aurora as one of the provinces under Nueva Ecija Branch. Thank you.\r\n\r\nOCD/John','assets/uploads/support/ticket-129-1787032489-1237c52c.png','Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 08:39:42','2026-08-18 05:54:49','2026-08-25 08:49:10'),(80,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/index.php\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:32:15','2026-08-18 06:26:00','2026-08-25 06:32:32'),(81,581,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:32:15','2026-08-18 07:29:10','2026-08-25 06:32:32'),(82,581,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:32:15','2026-08-18 07:30:24','2026-08-25 06:32:32'),(83,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-18 10:03:59','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(84,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/138.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-19 00:02:40','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(85,39,'REQUEST FOR THE INCLUSION OF NET KILOGRAMS (NKG) IN THE SUMMARY REPORTS FOR FARMERS WHO SOLD PALAY','Reports and Analytics','We respectfully request the inclusion of net kilograms (Nkg) in the summary reports for farmer who sold palay. Currently, the reports only shows no. of Bags, In MT, and Amount Paid (NFA), making it difficult to quickly determine the actual quantity procured per farmer. Including Nkg will improve transparency, accuracy, and monitoring of farmer deliveries.','assets/uploads/support/ticket-39-1787104519-6d7f132a.png','Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 08:47:56','2026-08-19 01:55:19','2026-08-25 08:49:10'),(86,39,'REQUEST ON METRIC TONS (MT) CONVERSION FORMULA WILL BE BASED ON NET KILOGRAM (Nkg)','Data Correction','We also respectfully request that the conversion to Metric Tons (MT) will be based on Net kg/50 instead of using the number of bags reflected on the WSR. This is to ensure accuracy, since not all purchased palay are in standard 50kg per bag. Using Nkg/50 will reflect the exact MT procured.','assets/uploads/support/ticket-39-1787106080-30f1636e.png','Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:59:18','2026-08-19 02:21:20','2026-08-25 06:59:31'),(87,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/index.php\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-19 02:21:35','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(88,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/?fbclid=IwY2xjawTx9MpwZG9mBWV4dG4DYWVtAjEwAGJyaWQRMUZWWU05WGJUZ1Zpa3luQUNzcnRjBmFwcF9pZBAyMjIwMzkxNzg4MjAwODkyAAEeaywZgRYFSRT4ELvFqOA-I0p3swE0J4oK58A3CtGJPGTjlr51ldwDsxzniUI_aem_gllqobeeWGmn_aNTNnUMrA\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-19 02:32:27','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(89,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/index.php?show_login=1&login_error=1\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-19 02:34:44','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(90,96,'FARM WORKER AND LESSEE/LEASEHOLDER NOT INCLUDED IN THE LIST','Encoding Profile','farm worker is not included in the list. Also no option for lessee/leaseholder in the landholding data.',NULL,'Completed',1,1,1,'2026-08-19 04:53:21','2026-08-19 02:50:13','2026-08-25 06:14:02'),(91,458,'Cannot Encode Transaction Delivery for Orange Tag Farmers','Encoding Transaction','Good day po Sir! Hindi po namin ma-encode ang delivery transactions ng mga naka-Orange Tag na farmers (farmers without RSBSA number).','assets/uploads/support/ticket-458-1787109846-f55795b1.png','Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 08:48:07','2026-08-19 03:24:06','2026-08-25 08:49:10'),(92,96,'#90 FARM WORKER AND LESSEE/LEASEHOLDER NOT INCLUDED IN THE LIST','Encoding Profile','Sorry po. Accidentally clicked archive button. Pg mg encode po sa farm worker since d pa po included sa list, pwede pong owner muna ilagay then edit na lang pg updated na po?',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 08:48:22','2026-08-19 05:07:39','2026-08-25 08:49:10'),(93,96,'Average Yield not specified','Encoding Profile','Sa average yield po, hindi naman po naspecify sa  FIS ang per cropping. ok lng po ba ang i enter is yung main cropping lng po?',NULL,'Completed',1,1,1,'2026-08-20 04:21:23','2026-08-19 05:21:10','2026-08-25 03:47:32'),(94,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-19 08:57:59','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(95,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/index.php\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-20 00:30:35','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(96,458,'Additional Clarification','Encoding Transaction','Sir diba sabi niyo. I will encode the exact NKG stipulated in the WSR. However, this means the total amount will be incorrect for PD1B, PD2A, and PD2B, since each classification has a different equivalent net weight factor. May I confirm that the system\'s total cost computation will be adjusted to apply the correct ENW factor per classification? I\'d also like to raise po that we are only given two weeks to edit transactions. If the adjustment is implemented after that, we will no longer be able to correct the affected entries on our end.',NULL,'Open',0,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-20 01:52:04','2026-08-25 03:39:30'),(97,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 10; K) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/138.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-20 02:41:48','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(98,316,'WAREHOUSE/BRANCH SIGNATORIES ALSO APPEARING ON NATIONAL/REGIONAL REPORTS','Reports and Analytics','THE SIGNATORIES ASSIGNED TO A SPECIFIC WAREHOUSE/BRANCH ARE ALSO APPEARING IN THE NATIONAL AND REGIONAL REPORTS, RESULTING IN INCORRECT SIGNATORY INFORMATION IN THE GENERATED REPORTS.','assets/uploads/support/ticket-316-1787197207-e8b91f56.jpeg','Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 08:48:46','2026-08-20 03:40:07','2026-08-25 08:49:10'),(99,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-20 04:45:35','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(100,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/109.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-20 07:47:06','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(101,67,'No Facility Name available under the Province','Location Library','Good day, Sir/Ma’am.\r\n\r\nI would like to thank you for your prompt response to my previously submitted ticket regarding the addition of Davao de Oro Province under the Davao del Norte Branch Office.\r\n\r\nHowever, upon checking the system today, I noticed that there is currently no facility listed under Davao de Oro Province.\r\n\r\nIn this regard, I respectfully request the inclusion of the following facilities under Davao de Oro Province:\r\nLGU Compostela\r\nGID Compostela\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, to allow me to continuously encode profiles under the Davao de Oro facility, I will temporarily use Davao del Norte Province in the system. Once the Davao de Oro facilities have been added, I will update and edit the encoded profiles accordingly to reflect the correct province and facility.\r\n\r\nThank you very much for your continued assistance.','assets/uploads/support/ticket-67-1787413939-6b7094e8.png','Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:57:34','2026-08-22 15:52:19','2026-08-25 06:57:44'),(102,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64; rv:154.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/154.0',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 03:20:48','2026-08-25 03:11:27','2026-08-25 03:21:11'),(103,51,'Automatic error report','System Error','SQLSTATE[23000]: Integrity constraint violation: 1062 Duplicate entry \'SAMAHANG MAGSASAKA SA MOLASES MULTI-PURPOSE COOPERATIVE PARA ...\' for key \'name\'\nC:\\xampp\\htdocs\\fsr\\app\\Models\\FarmerOrganization.php:189\n\nPage: /fsr/index.php?page=farmer-organization-library&region_id=22&branch_id=27&province_id=56&warehouse_id=266&classification=organizations&edit_id=29403\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:32:15','2026-08-25 03:40:53','2026-08-25 06:32:32'),(104,349,'VARIETY FOR EDIT','Encoding Transaction','PAGE 1 AND 2... SIR KINDLY OPEN THE ENCODING FOR TRANSACTION FOR THE SPECIFIC PAGE. I NEED TO EDIT THE VARIETY FROM PD1 TO PD1A/PD1B \r\nSTARTING FROM FARMER BEATRIZ CARIAGA TO PERLITA DIOCAREZ. THANK YOU',NULL,'Open',0,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-25 03:49:55','2026-08-25 06:57:18'),(105,53,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/index.php?page=farmer-organization-library\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/151.0.0.0',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:32:15','2026-08-25 04:47:46','2026-08-25 06:32:32'),(106,53,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/index.php?page=encode-farmer\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/151.0.0.0',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:32:15','2026-08-25 04:48:01','2026-08-25 06:32:32'),(107,96,'Decimal point','Encoding Transaction','Sir for uniformity lang po, diba po 3 decimal places ang i adopt sa bags? pag mag compute po ako manually ng bags @50, Ex: 8591.280 nkg/50 = 171.8256. ano po ang ipipick up ko na value? ang 171.825 na drop ang 4th digit or 171.826 na ni round off?  \r\nAnother question po, pati sa amount 3 decimal point din po ang i pipick up? Sa SDO po kasi 2 decimal lng po ang nirereflect nila',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:35:16','2026-08-25 05:04:29','2026-08-25 06:35:23'),(108,NULL,'Automatic error report','System Error','Script error\n\nPage: https://sandbox.nfa.gov.ph/fsr/\nBrowser: Mozilla/5.0 (Linux; Android 11; CPH2059 Build/RKQ1.200903.002; wv) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/4.0 Chrome/150.0.7871.183 Mobile Safari/537.36 [FB_IAB/FB4A;FBAV/574.0.0.45.86;]',NULL,'Completed',0,1,1,'2026-08-25 06:14:37','2026-08-25 05:07:04','2026-08-25 06:32:38'),(109,521,'Cannot save transaction. Duplicate WSR ....','Encoding Transaction','Duplicate WSR and check other details daw po. wala pa naman sa sa system.',NULL,'Open',0,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-08-25 05:55:16','2026-08-25 06:14:20');
